[36m(WorkerDict pid=218555)[0m 
[36m(WorkerDict pid=218555)[0m The sum of the lengths of $t$ given lines over all test cases in the input does not exceed $10^5$.
[36m(WorkerDict pid=218555)[0m 
[36m(WorkerDict pid=218555)[0m 
[36m(WorkerDict pid=218555)[0m -----Output-----
[36m(WorkerDict pid=218555)[0m 
