[36m(WorkerDict pid=218555)[0m record1
[36m(WorkerDict pid=218555)[0m record2
[36m(WorkerDict pid=218555)[0m record3
[36m(WorkerDict pid=218555)[0m 
[36m(WorkerDict pid=218555)[0m 
[36m(WorkerDict pid=218555)[0m The i-line is given a string that represents the serve order of the i-game.
[36m(WorkerDict pid=218555)[0m 
[36m(WorkerDict pid=218555)[0m The number of datasets does not exceed 20.
[36m(WorkerDict pid=218555)[0m 
[36m(WorkerDict pid=218555)[0m Output
[36m(WorkerDict pid=218555)[0m 
[36m(WorkerDict pid=218555)[0m For each dataset, output the score of Mr. A and the score of Mr. B of the i-game on the i-line, separated by blanks.
