[36m(WorkerDict pid=218555)[0m Output
[36m(WorkerDict pid=218555)[0m 
[36m(WorkerDict pid=218555)[0m In a single line print the answer to the problem — the maximum number, divisible by 90. If you can't make any divisible by 90 number from the cards, print -1.
