[36m(WorkerDict pid=218555)[0m model_response Solve the following coding problem using the programming language python:
[36m(WorkerDict pid=218555)[0m 
[36m(WorkerDict pid=218555)[0m problem
[36m(WorkerDict pid=218555)[0m 
[36m(WorkerDict pid=218555)[0m $ M $ students will be tested in a classroom with $ N $ seats in a straight line. Seats are numbered $ 1 \ dots N $ from the front, and $ 1 $ per seat can seat $ 1 $ students.
[36m(WorkerDict pid=218555)[0m 
[36m(WorkerDict pid=218555)[0m Now each student is sitting in the $ A_1, \ dots, A_M $ seats.
[36m(WorkerDict pid=218555)[0m 
[36m(WorkerDict pid=218555)[0m To start the test, the following conditions must be met:
[36m(WorkerDict pid=218555)[0m 
[36m(WorkerDict pid=218555)[0m * $ 1 \ dots M $ students are sitting in every seat.
[36m(WorkerDict pid=218555)[0m 
[36m(WorkerDict pid=218555)[0m 
[36m(WorkerDict pid=218555)[0m 
[36m(WorkerDict pid=218555)[0m Therefore, we decided to repeat the following operations until the conditions were met.
[36m(WorkerDict pid=218555)[0m 
[36m(WorkerDict pid=218555)[0m * Move the student sitting at the back and sit at the front of the vacant seats.
[36m(WorkerDict pid=218555)[0m 
[36m(WorkerDict pid=218555)[0m 
[36m(WorkerDict pid=218555)[0m 
[36m(WorkerDict pid=218555)[0m Find the number of operations required to meet the conditions.
[36m(WorkerDict pid=218555)[0m 
[36m(WorkerDict pid=218555)[0m 
[36m(WorkerDict pid=218555)[0m 
[36m(WorkerDict pid=218555)[0m output
[36m(WorkerDict pid=218555)[0m 
[36m(WorkerDict pid=218555)[0m Output the number of operations required to meet the conditions. Also, output a line break at the end.
[36m(WorkerDict pid=218555)[0m 
[36m(WorkerDict pid=218555)[0m Example
[36m(WorkerDict pid=218555)[0m 
[36m(WorkerDict pid=218555)[0m Input
[36m(WorkerDict pid=218555)[0m 
[36m(WorkerDict pid=218555)[0m 6 4
[36m(WorkerDict pid=218555)[0m 1 4 5 6
[36m(WorkerDict pid=218555)[0m 
[36m(WorkerDict pid=218555)[0m 
[36m(WorkerDict pid=218555)[0m Output
[36m(WorkerDict pid=218555)[0m 
[36m(WorkerDict pid=218555)[0m 2
[36m(WorkerDict pid=218555)[0m 
