[36m(WorkerDict pid=218551)[0m model_response model_response Solve the following coding problem using the programming language python:
[36m(WorkerDict pid=218551)[0m 
[36m(WorkerDict pid=218551)[0m # Definition (Primorial Of a Number)
[36m(WorkerDict pid=218551)[0m 
[36m(WorkerDict pid=218551)[0m *Is similar to factorial of a number*, **_In primorial_**, not all the natural numbers get multiplied, **_only prime numbers are multiplied to calculate the primorial of a number_**. It's denoted with **_P_****_#_** and it is the product of the first n prime numbers.
[36m(WorkerDict pid=218551)[0m ___ 
[36m(WorkerDict pid=218551)[0m 
[36m(WorkerDict pid=218551)[0m # Task
[36m(WorkerDict pid=218551)[0m 
[36m(WorkerDict pid=218551)[0m **_Given_** *a number N* , **_calculate its primorial_**. ![!alt](https://i.imgur.com/mdX8dJP.png)  ![!alt](https://i.imgur.com/mdX8dJP.png)  
[36m(WorkerDict pid=218551)[0m ___
[36m(WorkerDict pid=218551)[0m 
[36m(WorkerDict pid=218551)[0m # Notes
[36m(WorkerDict pid=218551)[0m 
[36m(WorkerDict pid=218551)[0m * **_Only positive_** numbers *will be passed (N > 0)* .
[36m(WorkerDict pid=218551)[0m ___
[36m(WorkerDict pid=218551)[0m 
[36m(WorkerDict pid=218551)[0m # Input >> Output Examples:
[36m(WorkerDict pid=218551)[0m 
[36m(WorkerDict pid=218551)[0m ``` cpp
[36m(WorkerDict pid=218551)[0m 1- numPrimorial (3) ==> return (30)
[36m(WorkerDict pid=218551)[0m ```
[36m(WorkerDict pid=218551)[0m 
[36m(WorkerDict pid=218551)[0m ## **_Explanation_**:
[36m(WorkerDict pid=218551)[0m 
[36m(WorkerDict pid=218551)[0m **_Since_** *the passed number is (3)* ,**_Then_** **_the primorial_** *should obtained by multiplying*  ```2 * 3 * 5 = 30 .```
[36m(WorkerDict pid=218551)[0m 
[36m(WorkerDict pid=218551)[0m ### Mathematically written as , **_P_**3**_#_** = 30 .
[36m(WorkerDict pid=218551)[0m ___ 
[36m(WorkerDict pid=218551)[0m 
[36m(WorkerDict pid=218551)[0m ## **_Explanation_**:
[36m(WorkerDict pid=218551)[0m 
[36m(WorkerDict pid=218551)[0m **_Since_** *the passed number is (5)* ,**_Then_** **_the primorial_** *should obtained by multiplying*  ``` 2 * 3 * 5 * 7 * 11 = 2310 .```
[36m(WorkerDict pid=218551)[0m 
[36m(WorkerDict pid=218551)[0m ### Mathematically written as , **_P_**5**_#_** = 2310 .
[36m(WorkerDict pid=218551)[0m ___
[36m(WorkerDict pid=218551)[0m 
[36m(WorkerDict pid=218551)[0m ## **_Explanation_**: 
[36m(WorkerDict pid=218551)[0m 
[36m(WorkerDict pid=218551)[0m **_Since_** *the passed number is (6)* ,**_Then_** **_the primorial_** *should obtained by multiplying*  ``` 2 * 3 * 5 * 7 * 11 * 13 = 30030 .```
[36m(WorkerDict pid=218551)[0m 
[36m(WorkerDict pid=218551)[0m ### Mathematically written as , **_P_**6**_#_** = 30030 .
