[36m(WorkerDict pid=218551)[0m 
[36m(WorkerDict pid=218551)[0m The first line contains integer n (1 ≤ n ≤ 105) — amount of elements in the sequence. The second line contains n integers ai ( - 104 ≤ ai ≤ 104) — the sequence itself.
