[36m(WorkerDict pid=218551)[0m 
[36m(WorkerDict pid=218551)[0m ```python
[36m(WorkerDict pid=218551)[0m def solve(x, y):
[36m(WorkerDict pid=218551)[0m 	
[36m(WorkerDict pid=218551)[0m ```
