[36m(WorkerDict pid=218551)[0m 6
[36m(WorkerDict pid=218551)[0m ----- explanation 1 ------ 
[36m(WorkerDict pid=218551)[0m Case 1 : Maximum possible sum of scores = 11 + 10 + 9 = 30 and can be achieved only by selecting the last 3 players. Only one possible way.
