[36m(WorkerDict pid=218553)[0m 
[36m(WorkerDict pid=218553)[0m Followed by Q strings Qi.
[36m(WorkerDict pid=218553)[0m 
[36m(WorkerDict pid=218553)[0m Each string Si, Qi contain only lowercase Latin alphabets ('a' - 'z') and '-'.
[36m(WorkerDict pid=218553)[0m 
[36m(WorkerDict pid=218553)[0m Q – lines, each contain the answer for each of the query.
[36m(WorkerDict pid=218553)[0m 
