[36m(WorkerDict pid=218554)[0m S
[36m(WorkerDict pid=218554)[0m K
[36m(WorkerDict pid=218554)[0m 
[36m(WorkerDict pid=218554)[0m 
[36m(WorkerDict pid=218554)[0m 
[36m(WorkerDict pid=218554)[0m Print the minimum number of operations required.
[36m(WorkerDict pid=218554)[0m 
