[36m(WorkerDict pid=218554)[0m * 1 ≦ A_i ≦ 10^9(1 ≦ i ≦ N)
[36m(WorkerDict pid=218554)[0m * All inputs are integers.
[36m(WorkerDict pid=218554)[0m 
