[36m(WorkerDict pid=218554)[0m 
[36m(WorkerDict pid=218554)[0m In the second example, f(x) = x^2 + 205x + 92 = (x - 9)·(x + 214) + 2018.
[36m(WorkerDict pid=218554)[0m 
