[36m(WorkerDict pid=218550)[0m 
[36m(WorkerDict pid=218550)[0m Each test case contains 1 positive integer N, with not more than 1000 digits.
[36m(WorkerDict pid=218550)[0m 
[36m(WorkerDict pid=218550)[0m ------ Output ------ 
[36m(WorkerDict pid=218550)[0m 
[36m(WorkerDict pid=218550)[0m Print YES if N is an Asmany number, NO otherwise.
[36m(WorkerDict pid=218550)[0m 
[36m(WorkerDict pid=218550)[0m ------ Constraints ------ 
[36m(WorkerDict pid=218550)[0m 
[36m(WorkerDict pid=218550)[0m 1 ≤ T ≤ 100
[36m(WorkerDict pid=218550)[0m 1 ≤ Number of digits in N ≤ 1000
