[36m(WorkerDict pid=218556)[0m There are N apple trees in a row. People say that one of them will bear golden apples.
[36m(WorkerDict pid=218556)[0m 
[36m(WorkerDict pid=218556)[0m We want to deploy some number of inspectors so that each of these trees will be inspected.
[36m(WorkerDict pid=218556)[0m 
[36m(WorkerDict pid=218556)[0m Each inspector will be deployed under one of the trees. For convenience, we will assign numbers from 1 through N to the trees. An inspector deployed under the i-th tree (1 \leq i \leq N) will inspect the trees with numbers between i-D and i+D (inclusive).
[36m(WorkerDict pid=218556)[0m 
