[36m(WorkerDict pid=218550)[0m 
[36m(WorkerDict pid=218550)[0m Constraints:
[36m(WorkerDict pid=218550)[0m 1 ≤ N ≤ 3,000
[36m(WorkerDict pid=218550)[0m 0 ≤ Xi, Yi, Fi ≤ 100,000
