[36m(WorkerDict pid=218256)[0m Have you ever used the chat application QQ? Well, in a chat group of QQ, administrators can muzzle a user for days.
[36m(WorkerDict pid=218256)[0m 
[36m(WorkerDict pid=218256)[0m In Boboniu's chat group, there's a person called Du Yi who likes to make fun of Boboniu every day.
[36m(WorkerDict pid=218256)[0m 
[36m(WorkerDict pid=218256)[0m Du will chat in the group for n days. On the i-th day:
[36m(WorkerDict pid=218256)[0m 
[36m(WorkerDict pid=218256)[0m   * If Du can speak, he'll make fun of Boboniu with fun factor a_i. But after that, he may be muzzled depending on Boboniu's mood. 
[36m(WorkerDict pid=218256)[0m   * Otherwise, Du won't do anything. 
[36m(WorkerDict pid=218256)[0m 
[36m(WorkerDict pid=218256)[0m 
[36m(WorkerDict pid=218256)[0m 
[36m(WorkerDict pid=218256)[0m Boboniu's mood is a constant m. On the i-th day:
[36m(WorkerDict pid=218256)[0m 
[36m(WorkerDict pid=218256)[0m   * If Du can speak and a_i>m, then Boboniu will be angry and muzzle him for d days, which means that Du won't be able to speak on the i+1, i+2, ⋅⋅⋅, min(i+d,n)-th days. 
[36m(WorkerDict pid=218256)[0m   * Otherwise, Boboniu won't do anything. 
[36m(WorkerDict pid=218256)[0m 
[36m(WorkerDict pid=218256)[0m 
[36m(WorkerDict pid=218256)[0m 
[36m(WorkerDict pid=218256)[0m The total fun factor is the sum of the fun factors on the days when Du can speak.
[36m(WorkerDict pid=218256)[0m 
[36m(WorkerDict pid=218256)[0m Du asked you to find the maximum total fun factor among all possible permutations of a.
[36m(WorkerDict pid=218256)[0m 
[36m(WorkerDict pid=218256)[0m 
[36m(WorkerDict pid=218256)[0m The first line contains three integers n, d and m (1≤ d≤ n≤ 10^5,0≤ m≤ 10^9).
[36m(WorkerDict pid=218256)[0m 
[36m(WorkerDict pid=218256)[0m The next line contains n integers a_1, a_2, …,a_n (0≤ a_i≤ 10^9).
[36m(WorkerDict pid=218256)[0m 
[36m(WorkerDict pid=218256)[0m 
[36m(WorkerDict pid=218256)[0m Print one integer: the maximum total fun factor among all permutations of a.
[36m(WorkerDict pid=218256)[0m 
[36m(WorkerDict pid=218256)[0m 
[36m(WorkerDict pid=218256)[0m 
[36m(WorkerDict pid=218256)[0m 
