[36m(WorkerDict pid=218256)[0m In the first example, you can set a'=[15, 5, 8, 10, 23]. Then Du's chatting record will be:
[36m(WorkerDict pid=218256)[0m 
[36m(WorkerDict pid=218256)[0m   1. Make fun of Boboniu with fun factor 15. 
[36m(WorkerDict pid=218256)[0m   2. Be muzzled. 
[36m(WorkerDict pid=218256)[0m   3. Be muzzled. 
[36m(WorkerDict pid=218256)[0m   4. Make fun of Boboniu with fun factor 10. 
[36m(WorkerDict pid=218256)[0m   5. Make fun of Boboniu with fun factor 23. 
