[36m(WorkerDict pid=218256)[0m -----Note-----
[36m(WorkerDict pid=218256)[0m 
[36m(WorkerDict pid=218256)[0m In the first sample, the optimal solution is to take all the rings and put them on each other in order 3, 2, 1.
[36m(WorkerDict pid=218256)[0m 
[36m(WorkerDict pid=218256)[0m In the second sample, one can put the ring 3 on the ring 4 and get the tower of height 3, or put the ring 1 on the ring 2 and get the tower of height 4.
[36m(WorkerDict pid=218256)[0m 
[36m(WorkerDict pid=218256)[0m 
